- `double sma100_1 = iMA(NULL,PERIOD_H1,100,0,MODE_SMA,PRICE_CLOSE,1)`, `_2 = ...2)`
- SL: 50 pips; TP: 100 pips; also monitor reverse cross for exit
- P3 sweeps: SMA periods (5/100 vs 9/100 vs 10/100), TP (50/100/150 pips)

